This is v0.6.3 of icrawler slightly modified for lazylibrarian.
There is a new regex for google that had not been merged into master at the time, see
https://github.com/hellock/icrawler/pull/74/files 
bs4 parsing has been changed from lxml to html5lib as we already have that installed 
in lazylibrarian, and we try to use relative imports for bs4 and requests as some nas 
units do not have system-wide versions available

Only the Google, Bing, Baidu and Flickr crawlers and filesystem storage are kept (the greedy and url
list crawlers and Google Cloud storage are taken out), and the downloader opens only the image
formats LazyLibrarian does (JPEG, PNG, WEBP, GIF, BMP).
